, and lessons from the stories of previous prophets. It inspires faith, reflection, and trust in Allah\u2019s wisdom and mercy.", "short_description": "Surah Yunus emphasizes the oneness of Allah, the importance of patience, guidance for believers, and lessons from the stories of previous prophets. It inspires faith, reflection, and trust in Allah\u2019s wisdom and mercy."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25395235223485438"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_933198969096074_4687210939012934600_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqpdjPZD_1AQ7kNvwHafbUR&_nc_oc=AdoQn3o79puQdNngVLNv92sSuo1Q9ECtKiQXa0cKRJH8itf1W6h-T7d_cBQiaQUk1UQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSC6WipvoUboXnQ6gpSzsRls6lMz0ttzUONr3fooCDHQA&oe=6B031922"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Surah Yunus", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_cate